  "summary": "Applied Digital's AI data center campus in Ellendale, North Dakota, leased entirely to CoreWeave under roughly 15-year leases covering 400 MW of critical IT load. The first 100 MW building came online in two 50 MW phases in October and November 2025, and the 150 MW second building came online in two 75 MW phases by October 2026, for 250 MW operating. A third 150 MW building (ELN-04) is under construction, financed through a bridge loan later refinanced with senior secured notes in June 2026.",
